{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"3020510","name":"英雄立志传：三国志","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >三国的故事由你书写！《英雄立志传：三国志》是一款单机RPG游戏，你扮演一位英雄在汉末三国世界里做任何你想做的事。或扮演良将辅佐明君统一天下，或扮演君主割据一方，或扮演在野武将建立私军影响天下大势。交友结义，恋爱娶妻生子、经营家族、管理地产、在名山大川之中隐世修炼，培养自身及家族成员的武学口才，操练强军，或以不同视角体验与改变历史大事，或以权谋联立四方，或以兵锋横扫天下，使天下归心。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>三层次世界构筑</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>制作了大地图，城市界面与小场景三层次世界。从宏观的城市攻伐与军队推进，到城市中的建筑百态，乃至微观中的生活场景与剧情表现。尽可能地创造一个丰富多彩的三国世界。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>大地图：</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/da48faa78b0eb8b3e075198bf3b32bba.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/da48faa78b0eb8b3e075198bf3b32bba.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>城市：</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/325a6d0b7113f0425e7c7947ebc156b3.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/325a6d0b7113f0425e7c7947ebc156b3.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>小场景：</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/e287b6a62da2ddbceab5adefcdbec489.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/e287b6a62da2ddbceab5adefcdbec489.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>穿越时空的大舞台</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作包含20余个开局剧本，贯穿了从三国初期的《黄巾之乱》至三国末期的《西陵之战》的各个历史节点。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >并构筑了一个包含1300余个史实武将的大世界，制作了共计2000余个全身动态立绘。在游戏开始前可以自建武将，而游戏进行过程中也会不断有随机生成的武将出现在三国世界中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/d29b867324cdfccef883ae45ee7faf1e.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/d29b867324cdfccef883ae45ee7faf1e.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>丰富的玩法</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种核心战斗模式：包括军团战、武斗和舌战。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >其中军团战采用即时战略制，玩家需通过歼灭敌军、占领敌方建筑来达成胜利。战场地形复杂，作战地图分为野战，攻城战，县城战，水战和关口战，五种，共计百余张地图。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家作为上阵统帅，或只是作为众多将领中的一员，在战场上精准调度千军万马，运用巧妙战术，武将技能，阵型，攻城器械，以及30余个兵种的各色战法与相互克制，来歼灭敌军有生力量，伺机抢占敌方关键建筑，锁定胜局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/f977cbb7166c572f02b7a7a38868852f.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/f977cbb7166c572f02b7a7a38868852f.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/c1cd520867fc9322c69c0630052af17b.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/c1cd520867fc9322c69c0630052af17b.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/31fccd109f77270aebba734f02f3ee59.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/31fccd109f77270aebba734f02f3ee59.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=838 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >武斗和舌战则采取回合卡牌制，为提升在三种战斗中的表现，玩家需要提升每个武将的军魂、武魂和智魂，积累三魂点，学习并装备特殊的魂和技。游戏中有上千种各有特色的魂与技能，可以进行自由搭配，构筑你心目中的最强武将。而你的队友和对手则同样拥有各具特色的能力与流派，强攻流，防御力，暴击流，反击流，闪避流，反伤流等等，须因敌制宜，方可立于不败之地。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/8d767de069abc13c854910c25a5d1470.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/8d767de069abc13c854910c25a5d1470.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/4e72922f0289dcda3e4efc5b57c78d1d.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/4e72922f0289dcda3e4efc5b57c78d1d.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/0dffd25da9da75d0a3af14baf54512ca.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/0dffd25da9da75d0a3af14baf54512ca.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>多身份体验</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主公：扮演主公时，可以操控麾下的所有城市，也可将城市委任给太守。通过执行内政来改善每个城市的经济收支，将多余金钱用于军队组建和招募，发展科技或执行特定策略提升自身实力，待军队形成战斗力后发动战争，攻占敌城，进而统一天下。若是久居高位，身心俱疲，也可暂时将势力委托于亲信之人，游历四方，体验别样的冒险。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/9ae83f1798e2801d55651a834e5812ea.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/9ae83f1798e2801d55651a834e5812ea.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >武将：扮演武将时，则须勤恳工作，按时参加季度评定，尽可能积累功绩和发言力，争取早日被封为太守获得城市的指挥权。而太守之上，继续积累功绩，更可成为都督，统领一方。而以一名武将视角体验贯穿三国始末的那些历史大事，或是随波浮沉，淡然旁观，或是努力献策乃至在剧情战役中反败为胜，往往可以在剧情中改变主公与整个势力的命运。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/46503dd0dc1f8d82d4e1a82a5f075256.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/46503dd0dc1f8d82d4e1a82a5f075256.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在野武将：扮演在野武将时，通过跑商与地产经营获得原始基本积累，并在城市中建设军宅，组建私军，与各方势力签订雇佣军协议并助其征战四方。在战火中与各位豪强建立互信，签订信义契约，继而参与各个势力的各种历史大事。成为汉末的地下霸主。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/3da0b0bc72af6d7bd39f5e2aaae616be.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/3da0b0bc72af6d7bd39f5e2aaae616be.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>200余万字的历史剧情</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多身份多阵营体验历史：经过EA版至今的持续更新，本作已囊括了三国中几乎全部耳熟能详，甚至是人所罕知的剧情。贯穿了从黄巾之乱到东吴覆灭，近100年跨度中的上百个剧情，剧情总文本量高达200余万字。重现了三国历史中全部经典战役和事件。而每一个剧情中，玩家都可以从特殊的身份和阵营视角亲身体验甚至改变历史。比如在赤壁之战中，你可以是曹操，是刘备，是孙权，是诸葛亮，是周瑜，或是三个阵营麾下的一名武将。可以在曹操阵中，通过舌战保蔡瑁与张允免死并将二人收归帐下，或是在最终的赤壁决战中击败孙刘联军，改变历史。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/6228ea2ffc96e14660ac56a26c9dbff3.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/6228ea2ffc96e14660ac56a26c9dbff3.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >改变历史走向：玩家可以依靠卓越的统兵才能，武艺，或三寸不烂之舌，逆转历史，如助袁绍打赢官渡之战，或在夷陵之战中使刘备方反败为胜击溃吴军，亦可协助丞相北伐，完成光复汉室的大业。在剧情中亦可救下那些本该殒命之人，略显平凡者，如又被华雄斩了的潘凤，被赵云擒杀的邢道荣，下邳之战后沉默赴死的高顺，官渡中被大势埋没的田丰、沮授。再如那些家喻户晓的英豪，如被宦官所害的卢植，早逝的英才郭嘉，被于吉索命的孙策，气亡的周瑜，命丧落凤坡的庞统，被计斩于定军山的夏侯渊，败走麦城的关羽，被小人所害的张飞，木门道中箭身亡的张郃，五丈原的诸葛丞相等等，主角均可在剧情中逆转其亡故之命运，弥补历史遗憾。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/8252beec5a983b582736d63f29ca74ee.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/8252beec5a983b582736d63f29ca74ee.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当然，你也可以反向更改历史，造成某些历史人物的遗憾。比如在连环计中避免貂蝉牺牲自己，阻止曹丕强娶甄宓，与诸葛亮凭才华竞争黄月英，代替孙策周瑜迎娶大小乔等等。实现曹丞相和姜维未竟之夙愿。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/b29df09d470d51f5686f66539bef0426.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/b29df09d470d51f5686f66539bef0426.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这些或是被你救下，或是被你“拐跑”的历史人物，有很大一部分会成为你的家族成员，成为你征战天下的强大助力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/6fe60d791c8c015a8d909148fff96e71.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/6fe60d791c8c015a8d909148fff96e71.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>多样的社交互动</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏中所有武将都可结交，通过聊天，使用话题，喝酒，送礼，斗鸡，切磋，外出同游，互相教学，助其工作，乃至各种武将的专属任务等等，拉近关系，与其成为朋友，挚友。进而与其建立特殊的羁绊。可以拜师收徒，教学相长。可以与其义结金兰，共创大业。或是与异性相恋，结婚，行房，生子，组建家庭，培养后代成才。即便是有夫之妇，亦可通过特殊手段，使其对你倾心并最终成为后宫团的一员。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/fc46a8498a3e402345fc1742fb070997.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/fc46a8498a3e402345fc1742fb070997.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/a36b1261c4b5ef08334dbb5e929e511f.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/a36b1261c4b5ef08334dbb5e929e511f.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>其他</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.城市委托任务：在每个城市中，玩家都可以接到有趣的任务委托，有的任务会有很强大的效果，比如死而复生任务可让一名已故武将死而复生。五岳巡礼任务可以大幅提高你的能力。比武招亲任务可以直接娶到一个优质的老婆。虎父无犬女任务可以直接把好友的女儿骗过来挪为己用等等。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/9b951d9223f47e1b11c77c606d66901d.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/9b951d9223f47e1b11c77c606d66901d.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.天下大会：每年在京城都会有天下大会举办，或是比武，或是舌战，或是比拼统兵之道。各地高手轮番竞逐，奖励丰厚。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.丰富多彩的世界：游戏中的世界是活的。Npc武将也会有自己的行为逻辑，对主公不满时会下野，甚至谋反。在野武将会组织私军在县城盘踞，会夺取薄弱城市或是空城自立为君主。武将之间会互相结交，结仇，每年也有概率诞下自己的子女。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.组队系统：一个好汉三个帮，游戏中的主角队伍可容纳五个单位，可以邀请武将与你同行，可以带着妻妾游山玩水，可以雇佣几个佣兵保驾护航，也可以雇佣几个马车队跑商搞钱。带着他们参加各种剧情时，他们也会在各种武斗时出场，若是单打独斗，可是很难改变历史的。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/d283d9da8b1d70554c7d52e42050c346.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/d283d9da8b1d70554c7d52e42050c346.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.动态的大地图事件：大地图上总是有新鲜事发生，主角赶路时可能会遭遇劫匪，山贼，蛮族，猛兽。但也会邂逅行商，铁匠，甚至是仙人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6.家族系统：除了玩家自己的家族外，游戏中会有很多门阀氏族，各自为己方家族谋利，与主角竞逐地产，抢占市场，或者相互扶持，或是暗自算计。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7.跑商与经营：通过在队伍中招聘马车队，并在不同城市间倒买倒卖可以实现快速盈利，继而组建商会，派遣家族成员统领商会，实现自动盈利。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8.私军：家族武将可以帮你打理私军，帮你打理在城市购买的房产，或者研发家族科技，家族科技则会直接影响私军的战斗力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9.合纵连横：各方势力会定期针对最强势力组建合纵同盟围攻，被围攻方则组建连横同盟应对；若身为主公可自由选择加入任何一方，体验权谋博弈的刺激与快感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10.建筑事件：武将不再只等你上门——好酒者邀饮、好玩者斗鸡、好游者同游；久未见面的情人恋人妻妾会登门，陌生武将也可能慕名结识；身怀医术时可去医馆协助治疗生病武将。但也有风波：治安不佳时自宅失窃、刺客行刺、武将谋害都可能发生，抓住搞事者可将其下狱，世事难料，总是有意想不到的事态展开。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11.节日事件：随着时间推进，特定节日将触发特定事件。除夕守岁宴、春节贺岁宴、上巳踏青、端午买粽子共度、七夕与重阳节提高对应互动的成功率。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12.灾害系统：城市有概率触发地震、洪水、旱灾、蝗灾、瘟疫、雪灾六种灾害，对商业、农业、人口和建筑物造成不同程度的损失或破坏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13.景区系统和宠物系统：你可以带着亲友一起游览全国各个名山大川并在其中修炼。也可以驯服熊和老虎等野兽并让它们在武斗中出战。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/66b9b7166dca6e3571c01bf8eabc3898.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/66b9b7166dca6e3571c01bf8eabc3898.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14.自建武将和修改史将系统</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可以自定义全新的武将，或在游戏开始时添加新势力。也可以将自制的cg放在Portraits文件夹中导入游戏。历史中的所有武将都可以在编辑史将中定义，修改他们的cg，模型，姿势和各种数值。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras/d25d3d8f7ab7beb8ad7df7cc3bfe5bb5.avif?t=1790149894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/extras_big/d25d3d8f7ab7beb8ad7df7cc3bfe5bb5.avif?t=1790149894 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15.除此之外，游戏中还做了很多丰富的功能，如锻造，纺织，鉴定等等，请在游戏中自行体验。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >———————————————————————————————— </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >写在最后的话：我们是一个仅有个位数人数的小团队，靠爱发电，花了五年半时间搞出此作，并在2025年3月在国区上线了EA版。又经过一年半的持续更新，如今终于准备上线正式版。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这里首先感谢各位玩家，没有大家的包容，支持和积极反馈，我们很难走到今天！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当然，游戏仍有很多不足，因为极高的自由度以及诸多系统，剧情中各种特定人物视角的剧情，以及各个系统之中，可能存在各种不足之处，希望大家能积极反馈给我们，帮助我们持续改进。美术方面，虽然经过了多轮更新，但仍有很多不顺眼的地方，这些我们都会继续精进。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >正式版是一个里程碑，但绝不是终点，我们会继续更新。希望能竭尽全力，做好一款属于国人的历史RPG沙盒游戏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/6080e48e30c65599cedb4f63ef970dc48ed6cb88/header_schinese.jpg?t=1790149894","website":"","developers":["Free Wing"],"publishers":["Free Wing","NPC Entertainment"],"release_date":"2026 年 9 月 23 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"19.99","final":"17.99","discount":10},"supported_languages":"简体中文<strong>*</strong>, 英语, 日语, 繁体中文, 韩语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["独立","角色扮演","模拟","策略"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GTX960 4G<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 10 GB 可用空间</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA RTX2060 6G<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 10 GB 可用空间</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/459bccb9d931636f946b388fbc6503350b2a6548/ss_459bccb9d931636f946b388fbc6503350b2a6548.600x338.jpg?t=1790149894","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/459bccb9d931636f946b388fbc6503350b2a6548/ss_459bccb9d931636f946b388fbc6503350b2a6548.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790149894"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/591e5e1e4b97f541e030d7aa59d12ab4361fead8/ss_591e5e1e4b97f541e030d7aa59d12ab4361fead8.600x338.jpg?t=1790149894","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/591e5e1e4b97f541e030d7aa59d12ab4361fead8/ss_591e5e1e4b97f541e030d7aa59d12ab4361fead8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790149894"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/ed55b8092cf4f3cdcab4f02feb64b8a6fda58e50/ss_ed55b8092cf4f3cdcab4f02feb64b8a6fda58e50.600x338.jpg?t=1790149894","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020510/ed55b8092cf4f3cdcab4f02feb64b8a6fda58e50/ss_ed55b8092cf4f3cdcab4f02feb64b8a6fda58e50.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790149894"}]}